 I swore to give your fathers. I…","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Samuel 7:16","note":"He went from year to year in a circuit to Bethel, Gilgal, and Mizpah; and he judged Israel in all those places.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 19:15","note":"So the king returned, and came to the Jordan. Judah came to Gilgal, to go to meet the king, to bring the king over the Jordan.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Kings 2:1","note":"When Yahweh was about to take Elijah up by a whirlwind into heaven, Elijah went with Elisha from Gilgal.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Hosea 4:15","note":"“Though you, Israel, play the prostitute, yet don’t let Judah offend; and don’t come to Gilgal, neither go up to Beth Aven, nor swear, ‘As Yahweh lives.’","source":"web"},{"ref":"Amos 4:4","note":"“Go to Bethel, and sin; to Gilgal, and sin more. Bring your sacrifices every morning, your tithes every three days,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1551","lemma":"גָּלִיל","transliteration":"galil","gloss":"Galilee"},{"id":"H1019","lemma":"בֵּית הַגִּלְגָּל","transliteration":"bet haggilgal","gloss":"Beth-gilgal"},{"id":"H1389","lemma":"גִּבְעָה","transliteration":"givah","gloss":"Gibeath-(elohim)"},{"id":"H1553","lemma":"גְּלִילוֹת","transliteration":"gelilot","gloss":"Geliloth"},{"id":"H6190","lemma":"עׇרְלָה","transliteration":"orlah","gloss":"(Gilgal)-haaraloth"}],"senses":[{"id":"H1537H","gloss":"Gilgal","relation":"H1537H ="},{"id":"H1537I","gloss":"Galilee","relation":"H1537I = a Spelling of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}